  "body_html": "<h1>Homogeneous and Spherical Spaces</h1>\n<p>This topic node contains the DAG modules <code>HS1</code> through <code>HS4</code>: homogeneous\nspaces, symmetric spaces, spherical varieties, spherical combinatorics, boundary\ndegenerations, and wonderful compactifications.</p>\n<p>The ordinary group case is treated as a basic special case of this relative\nframework.</p>",
